  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TradeMark East Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims at reducing specific barriers to trade and bringing down trade-related costs. It will identify top priority policy reform areas and establishing the (largely soft) infrastructure required to support success of the Macadamia, Mango and Mining value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
